OL,3,GNEWSAMy night as a bingo caller - can I
OL,4,Ahandle the full house?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHow hard is it to be a bingo caller? I
OL,7,Fdecided to learn from one of the best
OL,8,Fin the business.
OL,10,FI meet Josie Douthwaite on a busy
OL,11,Fevening at one of Hull's biggest bingo
OL,12,Fhalls, days before she competes for the
OL,13,Ftitle of National Bingo Caller of the
OL,14,FYear.
OL,16,F"Be clear, be quick, be confident," she
OL,17,Ftells me.
OL,19,FSounds simple enough, doesn't it?
